      "description": "### Impact\r\nA Denial of Service (DoS) vulnerability exists in the Protobuf PHP library during the parsing of untrusted input. Maliciously structured messages—specifically those containing negative `varint`s or deep recursion—can be used to crash the application, impacting service availability.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\nPatches have been released to 5.34.0-RC1 and 4.33.6.\r\n\r\n### References\r\n - Github issues: [issue 1](https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/issues/24159), [issue 2](https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/issues/25067)\r\n - Github commits: [commit 1](https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/commit/60e93d2d104f2af9cd345b1c6f3891d91430244a), [commit 2](https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/commit/c8e9b27d95c6ab2d0668b5889e7dac2c477b7038)\r\n",
